@startuml
title State Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> Login : User login


state Login
Login : do / validate user credentials


Login --> JourneyDetails : valid login and destination selection


state "Journey Details" as JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : display journey details


JourneyDetails --> DrivingModeChoice : [Driving Mode Choice]
JourneyDetails --> EatPlaceChoice : [Eat Place Choice]


state "Driving Mode Choice" as DrivingModeChoice
DrivingModeChoice : entry / User chooses driving mode
DrivingModeChoice : do / Enable driving mode
DrivingModeChoice : exit / Return to journey details


state "Eat Place Choice" as EatPlaceChoice
EatPlaceChoice : entry / User chooses eat place
EatPlaceChoice : do / Display menu and allow order placement
EatPlaceChoice : exit / Return to journey details


JourneyDetails --> AccidentNotification : [Accident Notification]


state "Accident Notification" as AccidentNotification
AccidentNotification : entry / System detects accident
AccidentNotification : do / Inform relevant authorities
AccidentNotification : exit / Send notifications and return to journey details


JourneyDetails --> Notifications : [Notifications]
Notifications : send notifications during driving or in case of an accident


state "Feedback" as Feedback
Feedback : entry / User completes journey
Feedback : do / Allow user to provide feedback
Feedback : exit / Return to login


JourneyDetails --> Feedback : [Provide Feedback]


@enduml
